sparky-stereo-skills (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: the public skills of Sparky Stereo OS from
    Sparky-OS/sparky-stereo-os at commit f350906a101c (with the documents'
    Markdown and the tools the skills link to) in /usr/share/sparky-stereo-os,
    and sparky-stereo-skills, which each person runs to link them into the
    skill folders of their AI assistants (~/.agents/skills, ~/.claude/skills,
    ~/.cline/skills and the assistants' own folders), to remove those links,
    or to make an archive for Open WebUI. Offered once at login when an
    assistant is found; after an upgrade the links follow the new skills.
    Strings in en, pl, pt_BR, fr, de, ja, ko, zh_CN and zh_TW.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:25:21 -0300
